33. What is the role of metrics-server?
Provides resource usage metrics to the Kubernetes API (used by HPA, kubectl top).

34. What is Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA)?
Scales pods based on CPU/memory/custom metrics.

Requires metrics-server and/or custom metrics API.

35. What are best practices for logs in GKE?
Write to stdout/stderr

Use structured JSON logs

Avoid sensitive data

Use labels for filtering

